  "repositoryControlledGaps": [
    "The native App Server caller does not yet consume kernel.authority's non-constructible VerifiedUseToken immediately before turn/start; CodexOperationIntent currently receives an equal caller-supplied lease_payload_digest rather than an authority-authenticated final-use capability. The caller now persists and binds the exact serialized final TurnStart payload digest; the remaining gap is authentication/consumption of that digest through kernel.authority."
